OUTPUT_PGASCN:  // from hitting F5 (Key.Calculate)
    //Send gpOutputPgaScn "" ("HitF5-" + (String(giOutputCounter)))
    Send OutputPgaScn to oPgaInfo.obj "" ("HitF5-" + (String(giOutputCounter))) //2025-05-02 KRC Throw into Object
    Add 1 to giOutputCounter
    ENTAGAIN 
RETURN // 2018-04-11 end 
 
